+# Café style generation prompts
+
+Generated with the built-in image generation tool, using `../base.png` as the reference. Final PNG files were resized to 1024×1024 with `sips`.
+
+## 43-rubber-hose.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE standalone 1024x1024 square artwork, completely redrawn in the target medium, using the provided photograph as the exact composition and character-identity reference. Preserve the same woman: shoulder-length voluminous curly auburn hair, freckles across cheeks and nose, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knitted sweater with rolled cuffs. She sits centered slightly right in a cafe, waist-up at a wooden table, face turned three-quarter toward the large bright window on the LEFT, eyes looking out to the left. Both hands hold the same ceramic coffee cup at chest height (one holding handle at image left, other wrapped around image right). Preserve the main shapes, relative scale, pose, framing, and object positions from the reference: leafy potted plant in lower-left foreground, croissant on a round plate at lower-right foreground, tabletop across the bottom, vertical window frames at left and cafe interior behind. Adapt local colors to the target style where its deliberately limited palette demands it, while keeping recognizable hair, glasses, freckles, sweater texture and character identity. Fully commit to the style's construction, line work, material and rendering: no photographic layer, no filter treatment. No text, letters, numbers, captions, signatures, logos, or watermarks. One image only; no montage or side-by-side layout.
+
+Target style: authentic 1930s Fleischer / early Disney rubber-hose animation cel artwork. Strict black-and-white and grayscale only, including grayscale translation of the auburn hair and mustard sweater. Bold organic ink contours, flat gray cel fills, rounded elastic arms, white cartoon gloves on BOTH hands holding the coffee cup, pie-cut black pupils inside expressive eyes visible through round glasses, simple curved mouth, lively curled hair silhouettes, dotted freckles. Keep the woman's recognizable facial features and mature adult identity within the cartoon vocabulary. Hand-drawn 1930s cafe background in restrained grayscale wash, subtle old-film scratches and fine film grain throughout. The main character must be fully stylized rubber-hose animation, not traced photorealism.
+
+## 44-blueprint.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE standalone 1024x1024 square artwork, completely redrawn in the target medium, using the provided photograph as the exact composition and character-identity reference. Preserve the same woman: shoulder-length voluminous curly auburn hair, freckles across cheeks and nose, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knitted sweater with rolled cuffs. She sits centered slightly right in a cafe, waist-up at a wooden table, face turned three-quarter toward the large bright window on the LEFT, eyes looking out to the left. Both hands hold the same ceramic coffee cup at chest height (one holding handle at image left, other wrapped around image right). Preserve the main shapes, relative scale, pose, framing, and object positions from the reference: leafy potted plant in lower-left foreground, croissant on a round plate at lower-right foreground, tabletop across the bottom, vertical window frames at left and cafe interior behind. Adapt local colors to the target style where its deliberately limited palette demands it, while keeping recognizable hair, glasses, freckles, sweater texture and character identity. Fully commit to the style's construction, line work, material and rendering: no photographic layer, no filter treatment. No text, letters, numbers, captions, signatures, logos, or watermarks. One image only; no montage or side-by-side layout.
+
+Target style: a detailed technical blueprint drawing, pure thin WHITE architectural/engineering line art on deep cyanotype BLUE grid paper. Precisely redraw the entire scene as a technical plan-like portrait illustration using contour lines, cross-sections, wireframe curves, geometric construction circles, centerlines, dashed alignment guides and dimension arrows. Use dimension ticks, extension lines and empty measuring brackets as measurement annotations, with NO readable text, NO letters, NO numerals and NO pseudo-lettering. Delicate white drafting strokes depict curls, round glasses, freckles, sweater knit, fingers gripping cup, plant leaves and croissant lamination. Flat blue-and-white palette only, no painted or photographic shading. Faithfully preserve the viewpoint and object positions of the photo.
+
+## 45-banksy-stencil.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE standalone 1024x1024 square artwork, completely redrawn in the target medium, using the provided photograph as the exact composition and character-identity reference. Preserve the same woman: shoulder-length voluminous curly auburn hair, freckles across cheeks and nose, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knitted sweater with rolled cuffs. She sits centered slightly right in a cafe, waist-up at a wooden table, face turned three-quarter toward the large bright window on the LEFT, eyes looking out to the left. Both hands hold the same ceramic coffee cup at chest height (one holding handle at image left, other wrapped around image right). Preserve the main shapes, relative scale, pose, framing, and object positions from the reference: leafy potted plant in lower-left foreground, croissant on a round plate at lower-right foreground, tabletop across the bottom, vertical window frames at left and cafe interior behind. Adapt local colors to the target style where its deliberately limited palette demands it, while keeping recognizable hair, glasses, freckles, sweater texture and character identity. Fully commit to the style's construction, line work, material and rendering: no photographic layer, no filter treatment. No text, letters, numbers, captions, signatures, logos, or watermarks. One image only; no montage or side-by-side layout.
+
+Target style: Banksy-like street-art stencil graffiti. Recreate the complete reference composition as bold, economical BLACK spray-paint stencil cutouts on a weathered pale gray brick wall, with exactly ONE RED accent: the coffee cup. All other imagery is monochrome. Distill her recognizably curly hair, round glasses, freckles, sweater and both hands into purposeful stencil islands and negative space. Use crisp stencil bridges, ragged spray overspray at selected edges, fine aerosol speckle, paint drips, worn mortar lines and chipped brick surface visible through the artwork. Cafe window, plant, table, croissant remain clearly recognizable in the same positions. The artwork is an actual painted street stencil mural photographed straight-on, not a filtered photograph printed on brick. No tag, text or signature.
+
+## 46-klimt-gold.png
+
+Reimagine the provided photo as a COMPLETELY HAND-PAINTED Gustav Klimt golden-period Vienna Secession portrait, 1024x1024 square. It must read as an early 1900s oil-and-gold-leaf painting throughout, including the FACE AND HANDS. Do NOT carry over photographic skin, pores, photographic eyes, realistic lens reflections or camera optics. Paint the woman's recognizable features as Klimt would: delicately stylized pale ivory face with visible soft brushwork, simplified calm eyes gazing left, subtle pink cheeks, small warm freckles, a gently curved closed-mouth smile and thin round tortoiseshell glasses. Auburn shoulder-length curls become rhythmic dark russet and copper arabesques, partly ornamented. Preserve precise reference layout: seated woman fills center-right, head upper center, both hands hold a coffee cup at chest level, elbows at table, window at left, leafy plant and pot lower-left foreground, croissant on plate lower-right foreground. Sweater silhouette stays mustard yellow with rolled cuffs but its knitted fabric dissolves into FLAT GOLD LEAF ornament: spirals, rectangles and jewel-like mosaic tesserae, hand-applied metallic leaf, subtle cracks and irregular edges. Clothing and cafe background are radically flattened decorative spatial planes; window frame and tree outside are simplified geometric gold and green forms. Table, ceramic cup, croissant and plant are visibly painted and decorative, never photographic. Restrained jade, black, ochre and russet motifs harmonize with luminous gold. Faithfully preserve facial identity and composition while completely rebuilding every surface through paint. No added objects. No text, signature, captions, watermark. ONE artwork only.
+
+## 47-dali-surrealism.png
+
+Use case: style-transfer. Create ONE standalone 1024x1024 square artwork, completely redrawn in the target medium, using the provided photograph as the exact composition and character-identity reference. Preserve the same woman: shoulder-length voluminous curly auburn hair, freckles across cheeks and nose, round tortoiseshell glasses, gentle closed-mouth smile, mustard-yellow chunky knitted sweater with rolled cuffs. She sits centered slightly right in a cafe, waist-up at a wooden table, face turned three-quarter toward the large bright window on the LEFT, eyes looking out to the left. Both hands hold the same ceramic coffee cup at chest height (one holding handle at image left, other wrapped around image right). Preserve the main shapes, relative scale, pose, framing, and object positions from the reference: leafy potted plant in lower-left foreground, croissant on a round plate at lower-right foreground, tabletop across the bottom, vertical window frames at left and cafe interior behind. Adapt local colors to the target style where its deliberately limited palette demands it, while keeping recognizable hair, glasses, freckles, sweater texture and character identity. Fully commit to the style's construction, line work, material and rendering: no photographic layer, no filter treatment. No text, letters, numbers, captions, signatures, logos, or watermarks. One image only; no montage or side-by-side layout.
+
+Target style: Surrealist painting in the manner of Salvador Dali, meticulous hyper-real OIL painting with extremely fine brushwork, strange crystalline light and dreamlike stillness. Preserve the exact woman, auburn curls, freckles, tortoiseshell glasses, mustard knitted sweater, pose and cafe object placement. Transform the coffee cup held by BOTH hands into soft melting porcelain: its rim and lower edge droop fluidly, but its handle, coffee and main form remain recognizable between her hands. Include a small melting pocket clock draped over the FRONT table edge in the open center-left space, not replacing the croissant or plant. Through the large LEFT window show a dreamlike empty desert with remote rock formations, immense still sky and elongated surreal shadows. Keep her face, hair and hands carefully painted and true to the reference. Rich ochre, amber, muted teal, warm skin tones, polished surrealist oil technique with subtle canvas and brush texture. No readable numbers or text on the clock.
+
+## 48-line-art.png
+
+Use the provided image ONLY as a subject and layout reference. CREATE A NEW DRAWING FROM A BLANK PAGE. Do not trace all details. 1024x1024 square. An extremely minimalist, elegant SINGLE CONTINUOUS BLACK LINE portrait on warm off-white paper. Use one unbroken fine black pen stroke, with very few graceful curves and generous empty paper, no multiple outlines. EXACTLY ONE flat muted MUSTARD-YELLOW shape fills the sweater silhouette underneath the black stroke. No other colors or shading. Same woman: adult, three-quarter face looking out the LEFT window, round glasses, curly shoulder-length hair, freckled cheeks, quiet smile, both hands holding a coffee cup at chest level. Preserve reference framing: woman centered slightly right, shoulders and elbows on table, plant in pot lower left, croissant on oval plate lower right, window on left. Draw curls as only a handful of broad curling loops rather than dozens of strands. Draw face and glasses in a sparse few connected curves; evoke freckles with THREE tiny loops linked by the same thin line, never a cloud of dots. Only a few flowing contours for both hands, cup, cuffs, plant and croissant. Background consists ONLY of a single simple left window-frame corner integrated into the continuous line; empty off-white space elsewhere. Do not draw cafe patrons or pendant lamps. All black contours connect into one unbroken line: clever pen transitions and deliberate simplification. Think extremely sparse one-line modernist portrait, not a detailed coloring-book drawing. Flat vectorlike pen ink and a single opaque mustard fill, no gradients or texture effects. NO text, signature, numerals, captions, border, watermark. ONE image, no collage.
+

